    "_discoveryPainPoints": "1. [ProcessHandoffFriction] Sales teams waste 3 days per week on admin and meetings instead of selling (intensity 8/10, stage: Customer Visit Execution) ← flagged as binding\n2. [TechnologyIntegrationFriction] NetSuite-Salesforce integration failure causing manual processes and system fragmentation (intensity 9/10, stage: Order Processing) ← flagged as binding\n3. [DataSignalFriction] Lack of customer intelligence requiring manual information gathering before visits (intensity 7/10, stage: Account Intelligence Gathering) ← flagged as binding\n4. [IncentiveCapacityFriction] Channel partners becoming order takers rather than proactive sellers due to lack of tools (intensity 6/10, stage: Channel Partner Engagement)\n5. [TechnologyIntegrationFriction] 90+ Salesforce customizations making standard implementations complex (intensity 8/10, stage: Activity Documentation) ← flagged as binding"
